\f1 . Knowing that YHWH is YHWH means no longer seeing Egypt (or any power) as staff worth grasping. It means recognizing that the categories by which you calculated \'97 agricultural production, armies, diplomacy \'97 were never the relevant variables. YHWH speaks and performs. Everything else is reed.\
For exiles who had watched Jerusalem fall despite Egyptian maneuvering, who had seen their calculation fail, the oracle offers not just explanation but transformation. Stop calculating that way. Not because calculation is wrong but because your variables were wrong. The world isn't divided into stronger and weaker armies. It's divided into what YHWH has spoken and what opposes or serves that word.
